raw.jobDescriptionEn:
Carry out tasks related to the development of credit risk policies and procedures within the assigned functional area, ensuring compliance with MB’s processes and regulations to successfully achieve the unit's overall objectives.
Establish credit risk management limits, credit risk management policies, credit policies, interest rate policies, etc.;
Provide guidance on legal documents, regulations from the State Bank of Vietnam (SBV), and develop the bank’s internal regulations related to credit granting;
Implement, collect, and handle credit risk management issues within the assigned scope;
Assess risks related to products and processes, and design mitigation and monitoring measures;
Develop and operate post-monitoring strategies, early warning systems, and limit management with customers."
